{
  "name": "novel-studio",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "private": true,
  "description": "有声画本工作站：小说 -> 画本 -> 录音 -> 对轨 -> 混音 -> 有声成品",
  "author": "Novel Studio",
  "license": "UNLICENSED",
  "main": "./out/main/index.js",
  "type": "module",
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=22.6.0"
  },
  "comments": {
    "node22": "Node 22.6+ 原生支持 TypeScript 类型剥离（--experimental-strip-types），因此 scripts/ 与 tests/ 不需要 tsx / ts-node / vitest。",
    "test-isolation": "test:all 使用 --test-isolation=none 让测试在当前进程内运行：node --test 默认会用 child_process.spawn + 管道收集子进程输出，在受限/沙箱环境下可能触发 EPERM；同进程运行可绕开，也更快。",
    "error-docs": "错误码文档（docs/23-错误码一览.md）的唯一来源是 src/shared/messages.ts。改动 messages.ts 或 errors.ts 后必须跑 errors:docs 重新生成；CI 用 errors:docs:check 拦截不同步。",
    "import-ext": "src/shared/*.ts 之间以及 scripts/ 的 import 显式带 .ts 扩展名，以便被 Node 直接以 ESM 执行（文档生成脚本要连运行时导入这些模块）。tsconfig 需开启 allowImportingTsExtensions，electron-vite 侧正常解析。",
    "template-types": "Vue 模板表达式是按 JavaScript 解析的，不是 TypeScript：模板里写 `(v: number) => f(v)` 会让 vue-tsc 报 TS1109/TS1005 并**跳过整个文件的类型检查**（真正的类型错误全被掩盖）。check:template-types 拦截这类写法，fix:template-types 自动去掉参数类型标注（类型仍由子组件的 defineEmits/props 推断）。",
    "no-postinstall-rebuild": "**故意没有 postinstall 钩子**。曾经有 `postinstall: electron-rebuild ...`，后果是：它在受限环境（禁止 spawn 子进程）里失败 → **整个 npm install 以非零退出码结束**，而依赖其实已经装好了，用户看到的却是一个失败。更糟的是它掩盖了真正的问题——electron 二进制没下载。正确做法：npm install 只装依赖（electron 自己的 postinstall 会下载 Electron 二进制），原生模块 ABI 重建由需要的人在需要的时候显式跑 `npm run rebuild`。",
    "runtime-assets": "迁移 SQL 是运行时 readFileSync 读的（打包器不认识 .sql，不会带进 bundle）。关键事实：electron-vite 把整个主进程**内联成单个** out/main/index.js，所以被内联的 `dirname(import.meta.url)` **就是 outDir 本身** —— SQL 必须复制到 outDir，写成任何子目录（哪怕是照抄源码树形状的 infra/db/migrations）都会 ENOENT，表现为「应用能开窗口、但一张业务表都没有」。真机日志实证：ENOENT …\\out\\main\\001_init.sql。check:assets 直接 import electron.vite.config.ts 取出插件、对着临时 outDir 真跑一次 writeBundle 来验证 —— 这样绕开了本环境禁止 spawn（esbuild 起不来）导致配置加载不了的死结。"
  },
  "scripts": {
    "dev": "electron-vite dev",
    "build": "npm run typecheck && electron-vite build",
    "preview": "electron-vite preview",
    "typecheck": "vue-tsc --noEmit -p tsconfig.web.json && tsc --noEmit -p tsconfig.node.json",
    "lint": "eslint . --ext .ts,.vue",
    "format": "prettier --write \"src/**/*.{ts,vue,css}\" \"docs/**/*.md\" \"scripts/**/*.ts\" \"tests/**/*.ts\"",
    "ensure:electron": "node --experimental-strip-types scripts/ensure-electron.ts",
    "fetch:native-prebuild": "node --experimental-strip-types scripts/fetch-native-prebuild.ts",
    "check:native": "node --experimental-strip-types scripts/check-native.ts",
    "check:config": "node --experimental-strip-types scripts/probe-vite-config.ts",
    "check:assets": "node --experimental-strip-types scripts/check-runtime-assets.ts",
    "rebuild": "electron-rebuild -f -w better-sqlite3,onnxruntime-node",
    "test": "node --experimental-strip-types scripts/run-tests.ts",
    "test:all": "node --experimental-strip-types scripts/run-tests.ts",
    "test:filter": "node --experimental-strip-types scripts/run-tests.ts --filter",
    "errors:docs": "node --experimental-strip-types scripts/gen-error-docs.ts",
    "errors:docs:check": "node --experimental-strip-types scripts/gen-error-docs.ts --check",
    "errors:docs:table": "node --experimental-strip-types scripts/gen-error-docs.ts --table",
    "errors:docs:json": "node --experimental-strip-types scripts/gen-error-docs.ts --json",
    "check:renderer": "node --experimental-strip-types scripts/check-renderer.ts",
    "check:structure": "node --experimental-strip-types scripts/check-structure.ts",
    "check:syntax": "node --experimental-strip-types scripts/check-syntax.ts",
    "check:template-types": "node --experimental-strip-types scripts/strip-template-types.ts --check",
    "fix:template-types": "node --experimental-strip-types scripts/strip-template-types.ts --write",
    "check:coverage": "node --experimental-strip-types scripts/check-coverage.ts",
    "check:coverage:strict": "node --experimental-strip-types scripts/check-coverage.ts --strict",
    "fix:imports": "node --experimental-strip-types scripts/fix-relative-imports.ts --write",
    "fix:imports:check": "node --experimental-strip-types scripts/fix-relative-imports.ts --check",
    "verify": "npm run check:syntax && npm run check:template-types && npm run check:assets && npm run test && npm run errors:docs:check && npm run check:structure && npm run fix:imports:check",
    "dist:win": "npm run build && electron-builder --win --x64",
    "dist:mac": "npm run build && electron-builder --mac",
    "dist:linux": "npm run build && electron-builder --linux"
  },
  "dependencies": {
    "electron-log": "^5.1.7",
    "better-sqlite3": "11.3.0",
    "fluent-ffmpeg": "^2.1.3",
    "onnxruntime-node": "1.19.2",
    "@xenova/transformers": "^2.17.2",
    "iconv-lite": "^0.6.3",
    "chardet": "^2.1.0",
    "mammoth": "^1.8.0",
    "pdfjs-dist": "^4.6.82",
    "cheerio": "^1.0.0",
    "undici": "^6.19.8",
    "zod": "^3.23.8",
    "archiver": "^7.0.1",
    "yauzl": "^3.1.3",
    "fast-json-stable-stringify": "^2.1.0",
    "nanoid": "^5.0.7",
    "dayjs": "^1.11.13",
    "p-limit": "^6.1.0",
    "vue": "^3.5.12",
    "vue-router": "^4.4.5",
    "pinia": "^2.2.6",
    "element-plus": "^2.8.8",
    "@element-plus/icons-vue": "^2.3.1",
    "@vueuse/core": "^11.1.0",
    "wavesurfer.js": "^7.8.6"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "electron": "31.7.0",
    "electron-vite": "^2.3.0",
    "electron-builder": "^25.1.8",
    "@electron/rebuild": "^3.7.1",
    "vite": "^5.4.11",
    "@vitejs/plugin-vue": "^5.2.0",
    "typescript": "^5.6.3",
    "vue-tsc": "^2.1.10",
    "eslint": "^9.14.0",
    "@typescript-eslint/eslint-plugin": "^8.13.0",
    "@typescript-eslint/parser": "^8.13.0",
    "eslint-plugin-vue": "^9.31.0",
    "prettier": "^3.3.3",
    "sass": "^1.80.6",
    "unplugin-auto-import": "^0.18.4",
    "unplugin-vue-components": "^0.27.4",
    "@types/better-sqlite3": "^7.6.11",
    "@types/fluent-ffmpeg": "^2.1.27",
    "@types/archiver": "^6.0.3",
    "@types/yauzl": "^2.10.3",
    "@types/node": "^22.9.0"
  },
  "pnpm": {
    "onlyBuiltDependencies": [
      "better-sqlite3",
      "onnxruntime-node",
      "electron",
      "esbuild"
    ]
  },
  "build": {
    "appId": "com.novelstudio.app",
    "productName": "Novel Studio",
    "directories": {
      "output": "release",
      "buildResources": "resources"
    },
    "files": [
      "out/**/*",
      "package.json"
    ],
    "extraResources": [
      {
        "from": "resources/bin",
        "to": "bin"
      },
      {
        "from": "resources/models",
        "to": "models"
      }
    ],
    "asarUnpack": [
      "**/node_modules/better-sqlite3/**",
      "**/node_modules/onnxruntime-node/**",
      "**/*.node",
      "resources/bin/**",
      "resources/models/**"
    ],
    "win": {
      "target": [
        "nsis"
      ],
      "artifactName": "${productName}-${version}-setup.${ext}"
    },
    "nsis": {
      "oneClick": false,
      "allowToChangeInstallationDirectory": true
    },
    "mac": {
      "target": [
        "dmg"
      ],
      "category": "public.app-category.music"
    },
    "linux": {
      "target": [
        "AppImage"
      ],
      "category": "Audio"
    }
  }
}
